WP1007002","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10915","name":{"zh":"北伐中原","en":"Northern Expedition"},"year":"227","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[60,55,80,70,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[60,55,80,70,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[60,55,80,70,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1022","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[60,55,80,70,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[60,55,80,70,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"94","reputation":"11650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10317","city":"CS1022","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[60,55,80,70,82,85],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"94","reputation":"11650","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007002","armor":"WP1013805","helmet":"WP1025705"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"汉末陈留名士，卫臻之父。少有才名，明察知人，不妄交游。早年郡府举孝廉，公府辟召，皆辞而不就。董卓乱政，天下摇动，卫兹见曹操有雄略，叹曰：“平天下者，必此人也。”遂倾家资，募兵五千余人，资助曹操起兵讨董，为曹操最早的金主与核心支持者。初平元年，曹操引兵西进，于荥阳汴水遭遇董卓部将徐荣。曹军新募之众，未经战阵，大败溃散。卫兹力战殉国，死于阵中。其子卫臻后来仕魏，位至三公。","tc":"漢末陳留名士，衛臻之父。少有才名，明察知人，不妄交游。早年郡府舉孝廉，公府辟召，皆辭而不就。董卓亂政，天下搖動，衛茲見曹操有雄略，嘆曰：“平天下者，必此人也。” 遂傾家資，募兵五千余人，資助曹操起兵討董，為曹操最早的金主與核心支持者。初平元年，曹操引兵西進，于滎陽汴水遭遇董卓部將徐榮。曹軍新募之眾，未經戰陣，大敗潰散。衛茲力戰殉國，死于陣中。其子衛臻后來仕魏，位至三公。","en":"A Filial and Incorrupt of the late Eastern Han. Wei Zi's most notable deed was exhausting his family fortune in the sixth year of Zhongping to fund Cao Cao's rising, helping him recruit over 5,000 men to secure his initial footing. Wei Zi once remarked, ‘The one who brings peace to the realm will surely be this man.’ In the first year of Chuping, serving as an officer under Governor of Chenliu Zhang Miao, he followed Cao Cao to subjugate Dong Zhuo, but fell in fierce combat at Xingyang fighting Dong Zhuo's general Xu Rong.","jp":"後漢末期の孝廉。衛茲の最も名高い功績は、中平6年に家財を投げ打って曹操の挙兵を支援し、5000人余りの兵を募る手助けをして曹操に最初の基盤を与えたことである。衛茲はかつて「天下を平らげる者は、必ずやこの人であろう」と評した。初平元年、衛茲は陳留太守・張邈の部将として曹操に従い董卓討伐に参加し、滎陽にて董卓の部将・徐栄と交戦した際に奮戦して討ち死にした。","kr":"동한 말기의 효렴이다. 위자의 가장 대표적인 행적은 중평 6년에 가산을 전부 털어 조조의 거병을 지원하고, 5천여 명의 군사를 모으도록 도와 초기 기반을 마련해 준 일이다. 위자는 일찍이 '천하를 평정할 자는 필시 이 사람이다'라고 평하기도 했다. 초평 원년, 위자는 진류태수 장막의 부장으로서 조조를 따라 동탁 토벌에 나섰으나, 형양에서 동탁의 부장 서영과 교전하던 중 분전 끝에 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1038315","remark":"","surname":"卫","surnameTc":"衛","surnameEn":"Wei","surnameJp":"衛","surnameKr":"위","surnameOther":"","name":"兹","nameTc":"茲","nameEn":"Zi","nameJp":"茲","nameKr":"자","nameOther":"","word":"子许","wordTc":"子許","wordEn":"Zixu","wordJp":"子許","wordKr":"자허","wordOther":"","icon":"卫兹","power":"WJ10001","rejectPow